  ∷ offCarrierEnergyVanishesByFlowPreservation
  ∷ crossLaneEnergyProductionSummableStatus
  ∷ crossLaneNonlinearitySuppressedRelativeToWithinLane
  ∷ noClayOrGlobalTerminalPromotion
  ∷ []

